<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy | Mosselora"
  description="Privacy policy for the Mosselora iOS and Android game, website, and browser preview."
>
  <article class="text-page section-wrap">
    <h1>Mosselora Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Updated November 26, 2026. This policy covers version 1.0 of the Mosselora game for iOS and Android, mosselora.com, and the browser preview.</p>

    <h2>The mobile game</h2>
    <p>You can play Mosselora offline without signing in. The game stores your garden, progress, and settings on your device so you can continue where you left off. Mosselora does not send those saves or settings to our servers. This version has no accounts, ads, or cloud sync.</p>
    <p>If you copy a garden or share a postcard, you choose where it goes. Your device’s clipboard or the app you choose to share with handles that copy. Links you open use your browser. Your operating system and app store handle any backups or diagnostics you enable under their own privacy settings and policies.</p>
    <p>Your saved game stays on your device until you reset it or remove the app’s data, such as by deleting the app. Copies you exported or backed up are managed separately.</p>

    <h2>Website and browser preview</h2>
    <p>This site does not have accounts, contact forms, advertising, or analytics scripts. The browser preview keeps puzzle actions in the page and does not send them to a server or save them in browser storage.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare delivers and protects this site. Cloudflare may process technical request information as part of providing its service. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for its handling of that information.</p>

    <h2>Support and privacy requests</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we use your email address and the information you choose to send to respond and resolve your request. We keep the correspondence as needed to handle your request and meet applicable obligations. For privacy questions or to request deletion of a support message, email <a href="mailto:hi@mosselora.com">hi@mosselora.com</a>.</p>

    <p><a class="text-link" href="/support/">Read support information</a></p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
